    "finalText": "Done. The URL shortener API is complete and verified:\n\n- **app/** — FastAPI app with SQLAlchemy 2.0 models, pydantic validation, and custom exception handlers returning `{\"error\": ...}` for 404/409/422 (including malformed JSON)\n- **alembic/** — migration creating the `links` table (unique `code`, `url`, `clicks`); redirects use an atomic `UPDATE ... RETURNING` so clicks increment exactly once\n- **start.sh** — `alembic upgrade head` then uvicorn in the foreground on 0.0.0.0:8000, DB settings read from `DATABASE_URL`\n- **README.md** — start instructions; **requirements.txt** — pinned deps\n\nVerified end-to-end over HTTP: all status codes/JSON shapes, 302 `Location` unchanged, click counts across restarts, and 15 passing pytest tests. Server stopped and test rows cleaned up — port 8000 is free for the harness."
